- Yes, very much.

00:00:02.723 --> 00:00:05.130
- And I think last time y'all
were doing a trip to Napa.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:05.963
- Yes.

00:00:05.963 --> 00:00:06.870
- I think, was it lovely?

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.250
- Yeah, we did have a good time.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.160
We went down and we saw her father,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.088
and we had a very good time.

00:00:13.088 --> 00:00:15.030
We like to travel together a lot.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.876
We've been married for
27 years and we really.

00:00:17.876 --> 00:00:20.357
(audience clapping)

00:00:20.357 --> 00:00:21.190
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:23.250
- Wait, that's like
striking out the picture.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.180
That was the easiest.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.890
That was the easiest applause.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.680
But no, we've been married for 27 years

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.210
and now it's that time, you know,

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.470
the kids have stepped outta the house

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.984
and we have more time to
spend together and so.

00:00:32.984 --> 00:00:34.067
- Get to date again.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:34.900
- We do.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.733
- I like it.

00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:38.520
- And so we found, we had
a plan to do some trips

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.260
and one of them was to go to Spain,

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.270
to do the Camino de Santiago,

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.170
which is a trail that
takes you from France,

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.840
on the French side of the Pyrenees.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.490
And you go over to Spain,

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.340
then you go to Santiago De Compostela,

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:56.550
which is about a 500 mile walk and.

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.555
- So it is true, there's
someone for everyone.

00:00:58.555 --> 00:00:59.880
(Kelly giggles)

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.380
- Well, I didn't know whether we'd last,

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.430
to tell you the truth.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.024
When you walk with someone for 500 miles,

00:01:04.024 --> 00:01:04.857
that's a problem.

00:01:04.857 --> 00:01:07.980
- No, just walking for
500 miles in general,

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.805
sounds like, unless there's wine.

00:01:10.805 --> 00:01:11.670
(Kelly giggles)

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.750
Well, how did the trip go?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.757
Did it?

00:01:13.757 --> 00:01:14.940
- It was great, it was fantastic.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:15.773
- [Kelly] Beautiful probably.

00:01:15.773 --> 00:01:16.606
- We didn't, make it the whole way,

00:01:16.606 --> 00:01:18.480
'cause I ended up with, with shin splints.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.760
But besides that, the first day was,

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.020
walking over the Pyrenees,

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.120
the second day was moving on through Spain

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.510
and we did about 220 miles
and it was incredible.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:28.830
And it was fun too because first,

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:29.910
you gotta get your backpack,

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:32.100
you gotta get all your parts
together and this and that.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.230
- Oh, that's the part I lack, the prep.

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.063
- And I was.

00:01:35.063 --> 00:01:35.896
- Buying all the fun stuff.

00:01:35.896 --> 00:01:36.729
- Exactly.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.100
You get to buy all the
stuff and pack it up.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.540
And I was all excited about,

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.100
I told her I've got it all planned out.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.360
We're gonna have our bags, you know,

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.060
taken from spot to spot, to hotel to hotel

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:46.320
and it's gonna be great.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.030
And she goes, we're not doing that.

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:48.863
- What?

00:01:48.863 --> 00:01:49.696
- So what do you mean?

00:01:49.696 --> 00:01:52.740
She goes, well, we're just
gonna stay wherever we stay.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:53.790
I said, where's that gonna be?

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.200
She goes, I don't know.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.500
She goes, maybe the Albergues
or the hostels or wherever.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.550
That's where we'll stay.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:00.420
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.260
- And I said.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.450
- I love that free spirited, yeah.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.175
- No, I said, no, no.

00:02:05.175 --> 00:02:06.720
I said, are you nuts?

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.730
But that's what we did
because she said yes.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:10.170
And it was a blast.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.820
We had the time of our lives.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.080
- I love that, being unplanned.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:15.560
Like it's like planned when like you,

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:18.015
I just love that you're
staying in a hostel.

00:02:18.015 --> 00:02:18.848
- That's it.

00:02:18.848 --> 00:02:20.010
That was my top bunk.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.170
And she stayed on the other top bunk

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.390
and the people behind,
below us that night,

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:25.258
remember that Cat?

00:02:25.258 --> 00:02:27.317
They were not happy people.

